*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0049
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-07-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 510
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0049.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FEE0049C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MONTHLY-FEE        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "MONTHLY-FEE=" MONTHLY-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF AC-ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'G'
       OR AC-ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'P'
       OR AC-AVG-BALANCE >= 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 5 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    END-IF.
